[2026-06-08] cloth-laplace directional residual detail layer
- Source change: particle-editor/spine-split-runtime.js.
- Added cloth detail helpers: buildClothDetailResidualLayer, estimateClothDetailDirection, propagateClothDetailResidual, applyClothDetailLayer.
- cloth-laplace now keeps the Laplace low-frequency base and optionally overlays a low-weight directional residual detail layer before writing mask pixels.
- Detail source is restricted to allowed sample pixels and excludes forbidden / occluder masks; strong edges and highly saturated color fragments are down-weighted or rejected.
- No patch/block synthesis is used for the detail layer; detail is propagated per pixel with distance falloff and default weight 0.12.
- Did not change AI inpaint, AI cutout, PSD export, undo/redo, UI text, or patch algorithms.
