- Problem: runtime-generated input/output files remained after closing and reopening the portable app.
- Cause: the packaged dist main process was behind source cleanup logic, and temp directory removal swallowed failures without retries, verification, or logs.
- Fix: make temp cleanup return results, retry removals, summarize remaining files on failure, log startup/before-quit cleanup outcomes, and sync the updated main process into dist/win-unpacked/resources/app/main.js.
- Scope: Electron main-process temp cleanup for runtime-generated, split temp cache, and AI sequence cache; no Runtime installer, model, workflow, renderer UI, or SeeThrough plugin changes.

